<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cenbank sells 182-day BBCs at 2.28 pct.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cenbank sells 182-day BBCs at 2.28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold 454 million reais of 182-day Central Bank Bonds (BBC) Tuesday at an overnight call money rate of 2.28 percent a month, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rate at the bank's weekly formal bond auction was in line with market expectations.</p>
<p>The auction result shows 454 million reais will be drained from the banking system as no old bonds are coming due Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo Newsroon, 55 11 2485418))</p>
